{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItems\">Inventory Items</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOwned\">Qty owned</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item On Qty QtyOwned To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">The <strong>Inventory Items - Qty Owned</strong> screen displays a complete list of transactions that affect the <em>quantity owned</em> for a specific inventory item.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And Is On Other Purchases Sales To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">This screen helps you track how inventory quantities change over time through purchases, sales, and other transactions.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Qty QtyOwned\">Accessing the Qty Owned Screen</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item On To ToDate\">To access this screen, navigate to the <strong>Inventory Items</strong> tab.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-inventory text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItems\">Inventory Items</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column InventoryItem Is Item Next On Qty QtyOwned To ToDate\">Next, click on the number displayed in the <strong>Qty Owned</strong> column for any inventory item:</p><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOwned\">Qty owned</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-t-white text-center p-2 text-[#428bca]\">32</div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Column Columns\">Understanding the Columns</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Is On Transaction Transactions\">The screen displays transactions in reverse chronological order, with the most recent transactions appearing first.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action InventoryItem Item On Select Sent To ToDate Transaction\">Each row represents a transaction that has changed the quantity owned of the selected inventory item.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Date On To ToDate Transaction\">The date when the inventory ownership transaction occurred.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item Off Other To ToDate\">This field tracks when inventory items were purchased, sold, written off, or otherwise changed ownership.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Current Date Is On Rent To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Future dates will display a warning indicator, as ownership changes typically reflect current or past events rather than future transactions.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Transaction\">Transaction</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Transaction\">Transaction</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action On To ToDate Transaction Type\">The type of transaction that affected the inventory quantity.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And InventoryTransfer InventoryWriteOff Invoice Off On ProductionOrder PurchaseInvoice Sales SalesInvoice To ToDate Transaction TransactionType Transfer Type WriteOff\">Common transaction types include <em>Sales Invoice</em>, <em>Purchase Invoice</em>, <em>Inventory Write-off</em>, <em>Production Order</em>, and <em>Inventory Transfer</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Business Column Is Rent To ToDate\">This column helps you identify how inventory ownership changes through different business activities and quickly understand the nature of each quantity movement.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action On Reference To ToDate Transaction\">The unique <em>reference number</em> assigned to each transaction.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem Item Name To ToDate\">The name of the inventory item being tracked.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BankOrCashAccount\">Bank or Cash Account</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BankOrCashAccount\">Bank or Cash Account</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Action Bank_account BankAccount Count On Transaction\">The <em>bank account</em> or <em>cash account</em> associated with the transaction, if applicable.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Custom Customer On Sales To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">The <em>customer</em> involved in the transaction, typically shown for sales-related transactions.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action On Supplier Transaction Transactions\">The <em>supplier</em> involved in the transaction, typically shown for purchase-related transactions.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Description On Transaction\">A description or explanation of the overall transaction.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"LineDescription\">Line description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"LineDescription\">Line description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action InventoryItem Is Item Line On To ToDate Transaction\">Detailed information about the specific line item within the transaction that affected this inventory item.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOwned\">Qty owned</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOwned\">Qty owned</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Is On Transaction\">The quantity change for this transaction.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Customers From FromDate Off Purchases Sales To ToDate WriteOff\">Positive numbers indicate increases in <em>quantity owned</em> (purchases, returns from customers), while negative numbers indicate decreases (sales, write-offs).</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action On To ToDate Total Transaction\">The <em>running total</em> shows the cumulative quantity owned after each transaction.</p></div></details><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Column Columns Custom Customize Edit EditColumns Is On Reference To ToDate\">Click the <strong>Edit Columns</strong> button to customize which columns are visible and arrange them according to your preferences.</p>",
  "key": "inventory-item-qty-owned"
